    "detailed_description": "<strong>Touch Maze</strong> - A 2D side scrolling game with procedurally generated levels that will allow the gamer to improve their hand eye coordination.<br><br>Featuring both a casual game mode and a hardcore game mode, touch maze is a fast moving game that uses your mouse cursor as the player. Point your cursor into the maze, click the button, hold it down, and then hold on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual Mode</h2>40 levels in casual mode.  Retry each level until you finish it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hardcore Mode</h2><br>Start at level 1 and continue until you crash.  Can you get past level 40? 50? 60?  It will continue to get harder until you crash.  What is your highest level?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your hand / eye / mouse coordination for other genres of games like FPS.</h2><br>Move your mouse through the maze and avoid all obstacles.  This will help you improve the control you have with your mouse that is important in other games like FPS.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Touch Maze</strong> - A 2D side scrolling game with procedurally generated levels that will allow the gamer to improve their hand eye coordination.<br><br>Featuring both a casual game mode and a hardcore game mode, touch maze is a fast moving game that uses your mouse cursor as the player. Point your cursor into the maze, click the button, hold it down, and then hold on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual Mode</h2>40 levels in casual mode.  Retry each level until you finish it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hardcore Mode</h2><br>Start at level 1 and continue until you crash.  Can you get past level 40? 50? 60?  It will continue to get harder until you crash.  What is your highest level?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your hand / eye / mouse coordination for other genres of games like FPS.</h2><br>Move your mouse through the maze and avoid all obstacles.  This will help you improve the control you have with your mouse that is important in other games like FPS.",
    "short_description": "A procedurally generated 2D side scrolling game that will allow the gamer to improve their hand eye coordination by avoiding walls and obstacles with your mouse cursor.",
